;" data-v-efbceb30><!--[--><div data-ui="cards-component" class="component"><div class="relative mb-8 sm:flex sm:items-baseline sm:justify-center"><span class="inline-flex w-full sm:items-center relative flex-col items-start sm:flex-row justify-center"><!----><h2 class="tc-title inline font-head text-2xl font-extrabold text-accent-900">Ontdek het verhaal, de textuur en het vakmanschap achter onze collecties.</h2><!----></span><!----></div><div class="grid grid-flow-row grid-cols-1 gap-x-4 gap-y-8 sm:gap-x-6 sm:gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,2fr))] lg:gap-x-8"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="theme-component group relative flex h-full w-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-white" data-ui="card-component" style="--v42b8017a:initial;--v7ee08286:initial;--v1499a124:initial;--v1cbe2312:initial;--v74152e1a:initial;--v7942f605:initial;--d0602bb6:initial;" data-v-efbceb30><!--[--><div class="relative overflow-hidden group-hover:opacity-75"><figure class="overflow-hidden relative rounded-lg" style=""><picture class=""><!--[--><source srcset="https://www.passionforlinen.com/uploads/images/medium_materiaaleigenschappen_f3dd16032f.jpg" media="(min-width: 640px)"><!--]--><img alt src="https://www.passionforlinen.com/uploads/images/small_materiaaleigenschappen_f3dd16032f.jpg" fetchpriority="high" class="object-cover object-center is-instant" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:center;"></picture></figure><!----></div><a class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" href="/nl/Materiaaleigenschappen/" aria-label="Go to details"></a><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-2 pb-2"><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><!--[--><div class="theme-component group relative flex h-full w-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-white" data-ui="card-component" style="--v42b8017a:initial;--v7ee08286:initial;--v1499a124:initial;--v1cbe2312:initial;--v74152e1a:initial;--v7942f605:initial;--d0602bb6:initial;" data-v-efbceb30><!--[--><div class="relative overflow-hidden group-hover:opacity-75"><figure class="overflow-hidden relative rounded-lg" style=""><picture class=""><!--[--><source srcset="https://www.passionforlinen.com/uploads/images/medium_op_tekstpagina_hoe_wordt_linnen_gemaakt_2_7b184bd186.jpeg" media="(min-width: 640px)"><!--]--><img alt src="https://www.passionforlinen.com/uploads/images/small_op_tekstpagina_hoe_wordt_linnen_gemaakt_2_7b184bd186.jpeg" fetchpriority="high" class="object-cover object-center is-instant" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:center;"></picture></figure><!----></div><a class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" href="/nl/hoe-linnen-wordt-gemaakt/" aria-label="Go to details"></a><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-2 pb-2"><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><!--[--><div class="theme-component group relative flex h-full w-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-white" data-ui="card-component" style="--v42b8017a:initial;--v7ee08286:initial;--v1499a124:initial;--v1cbe2312:initial;--v74152e1a:initial;--v7942f605:initial;--d0602bb6:initial;" data-v-efbceb30><!--[--><div class="relative overflow-hidden group-hover:opacity-75"><figure class="overflow-hidden relative rounded-lg" style=""><picture class=""><!--[--><source srcset="https://www.passionforlinen.com/uploads/images/medium_voordelen_linnenv_7f89e029dd.jpg" media="(min-width: 640px)"><!--]--><img alt src="https://www.passionforlinen.com/uploads/images/small_voordelen_linnenv_7f89e029dd.jpg" fetchpriority="high" class="object-cover object-center is-instant" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:center;"></picture></figure><!----></div><a class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer" href="/nl/Voordelen-linnen/" aria-label="Go to details"></a><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-2 pb-2"><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section></div><div id="intro"><div class="theme-component" style="--v42b8017a:initial;--v7ee08286:initial;--v1499a124:initial;--v1cbe2312:initial;--v74152e1a:initial;--v7942f605:initial;--d0602bb6:initial;" data-v-efbceb30><!--[--><div class="component"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center flex-row"><div class="grow basis-full p-2 lg:basis-1/2"><div class="prose-primary prose prose-inherit tc-text"><h4><span class="text-small"><strong>Over Passion for Linen</strong></span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ik geloof dat thuis een plek moet zijn waar het leven even vertraagt.</p><p>Mijn liefde voor linnen begon met de puurheid ervan – een natuurlijke stof die ademt, met de tijd steeds zachter wordt en met elk gebruik mooier wordt. Ik werd aangetrokken door de stille kracht en moeiteloze elegantie ervan. Vanuit dat gevoel ontstond Passion for Linen, inmiddels meer dan 15 jaar geleden.</p><p>In plaats van trends te volgen, richt ik me op het creëren van tijdloze essentials voor bed, bad en huis – stukken die natuurlijk, rustig en prettig aanvoelen om mee te leven. Elke collectie wordt ontworpen in Nederland en vervaardigd in Portugal, waarbij Europees vakmanschap en de schoonheid van eenvoud worden geëerd.</p><p>Voor mij gaat echte luxe niet over overdaad of perfectie. Het gaat over comfort, zachtheid en ruimtes die je laten uitademen.</p><p>Dank je wel dat je hier bent en kiest voor een zachtere manier van leven.</p><p>Liefs,<br>Barbara</p></div></div><div class="grow basis-full p-2 lg:basis-1/2"><figure class="overflow-hidden relative relative rounded-lg bg-accent-100" style="padding-bottom:calc(1 / 1 * 100%);"><!----></figure></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div id="content"><section class="theme-component tc-has-background-color tc-has-border" instantload="false" style="--v42b8017a:#ffffff;--v7ee08286:initial;--v1499a124:initial;--v1cbe2312:initial;--v74152e1a:initial;--v7942f605:#000000;--d0602bb6:#000000;" data-v-efbceb30><!--[--><div class="component"><div class="mt-4 lg:mt-0"><div class="prose-primary prose prose-inherit mx-auto mt-5 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-1 lg:max-w-none tc-text"><p><strong>Leveringen buiten Europa</strong><br>Voor verzendingen buiten Europa verzoeken wij u vriendelijk contact met ons op te nemen via <a href="mailto:info@passionforlinen.com"><strong>info@passionforlinen.com</strong></a> voor een persoonlijke verzendofferte.</p></div></div></div><!--]--></section></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></main></div><footer aria-labelledby="footer-heading" data-testid="element:footer"><h2 id="footer-heading" class="sr-only">Footer</h2><!--[--><!--[--><div data-ui="newsletter-subscribe" class="text-footer bg-footer -mb-8 mt-4 py-4 lg:py-8"><div class="container grid items-start gap-x-10 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-y-0"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Ontvang inspiratie, nieuwe collecties en updates uit onze wereld van linnen.</h2><p class="mb-3 mt-4 text-sm"></p></div><form data-ui="newsletter-form" method="POST" class="relative"><div class="w-full items-start sm:flex"><div class="w-full"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><!----><!--[--><!--]--></div><div class="mt-1"><div class="relative w-full"><!--[--><input type="email" placeholder="Je e-mailadres" class="block h-10 w-full border-accent-300 shadow-sm focus:border-info-400 focus:ring-info-400 disabled:bg-gray-200 disabled:text-black disabled:opacity-100 rounded-md w-full w-full" name="emailAddress"><!--]--></div><!----></div></div><div class="mt-4 items-start sm:ml-4 sm:mt-1 sm:flex-shrink-0"><button class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold cursor-pointer px-4 py-2 text-base bg-accent-900 border border-transparent hover:bg-accent-800 w-full font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 rounded-md text-white" type="submit"><!--[--><!--[-->Inschrijven<!--]--><!--]--><!----></button></div></div></form></div></div><div class="theme-component tc-has-background-color mt-12 border-t border-accent-200" style="--v42b8017a:#eee8e9;--v7ee08286:initial;--v1499a124:initial;--v1cbe2312:initial;--v74152e1a:initial;--v7942f605:initial;--d0602bb6:initial;" data-v-efbc